   ============================================================ */

/*
    This layer sits on top of the Part 1–4 simulation.

    Core philosophy:

      DISPATCHER
          ↓
      ROUTE REQUEST
          ↓
      SWITCH ALIGNMENT
          ↓
      ROUTE CONFLICT CHECK
          ↓
