   -------
   This renderer creates the dispatcher territory display.

   DESIGN RULES:

      BLACK   = background
      WHITE   = normal track
      GREEN   = lined route
      RED     = occupied track

   The territory is deliberately schematic.

   It is NOT a geographic map.

   It is NOT a modern video-game HUD.

   The board is designed to feel like a railroad
